[statement]
apk reads the names of the installed database before the repositories':
`ka` and `kb2304` share a bucket of apk's table, and the installed `zref`
mentions `kb2304`, so `ka` is read last and installed first, where the
repository alone would put `kb2304` first
(`install-order/names-sharing-a-bucket-the-one-read-last-first-xp-read-last`).

[repository]
P:base
V:1

P:ka
V:1
i:base

P:kb2304
V:1
i:base

[installed]
P:zref
V:1
i:kb2304

[world]
zref

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install ka 1
install kb2304 1
